      <item>
        <title>⚠️ Heads-up to anyone using the DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp inference demo: earlier versions had a RoPE implementation mismatch in the indexer module that could degrade performance. Indexer RoPE expects non-interleaved input, MLA RoPE expects interleaved. Fixed in https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp/tree/main/inference.</title>
        <dc:creator>@deepseek_ai</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>⚠️ Heads-up to anyone using the DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp inference demo: earlier versions had a RoPE implementation mismatch in the indexer module that could degrade performance. Indexer RoPE expects non-interleaved input, MLA RoPE expects interleaved. Fixed in <a href="https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp/tree/main/inference">github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepS…</a>.</p>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 03:00:56 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid>https://nitter.net/deepseek_ai/status/1990616182161068094#m</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/deepseek_ai/status/1990616182161068094#m</link>
      </item>
